<section id="shila-faq-v33" class="shila-faq">
  <h2 class="shila-faq-heading">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>How long before I notice a difference?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Most men report noticeable shifts in energy and morning drive within the first 2–3 weeks of daily use. The full effect typically settles in around the 6–8 week mark as your body adjusts to consistent trace-mineral intake. The 90-day guarantee is designed to give you a complete cycle to evaluate it for yourself.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Is the package discreet?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Yes — every jar ships in a plain brown box with no branding, no product name, and no descriptive labels on the outside. The only visible text is the return address and shipping label. Your privacy is protected from doorstep to inbox.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Try ShilaSource for the full 90 days. If you're not satisfied for any reason, just email <a href="mailto:support@wellnessnest.co">support@wellnessnest.co</a> with your order number. We process a full refund within 48 hours — no forms, no "store credit," no questions asked.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Are there any conditions where I shouldn't use this?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">ShilaSource is a natural Himalayan resin, but every individual is different. If you're currently on prescription medications, managing a chronic health condition, scheduled for surgery, or under 18, consult your healthcare provider before starting any new supplement. Not intended for women who are pregnant or nursing.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>How long does one jar last?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">One jar lasts approximately 30 days at the recommended pea-sized scoop per morning. Dissolve under the tongue or stir into a small glass of warm water or tea. Subscription customers automatically receive a fresh jar before they run out.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Should I talk to my doctor first?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">We always recommend speaking with your healthcare provider about any supplement you add to your routine — especially if you're managing an existing condition, on prescription medication, or have questions about how Shilajit may interact with your individual health profile.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>How do I cancel my subscription?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">Cancel anytime, no questions asked. Log into your account at <a href="https://wellnessnest.co/account">wellnessnest.co/account</a> and click "Manage Subscription," or email <a href="mailto:support@wellnessnest.co">support@wellnessnest.co</a>. Cancellations are processed within 24 hours, and you'll receive a confirmation email.</div></details>
  <details class="shila-faq-item"><summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary><div class="shila-faq-answer">We ship within the United States and to most major international destinations. Shipping times and fees vary by country — the exact rate for your address will appear at checkout. Standard US delivery is 3–7 business days; international 7–14 business days.</div></details>
</section>
